{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-mcp/tests/channel.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.731748Z","id":"4643b8805198331cfd586ef4c720626da877005020b1d2d06bf4883a5b223513","body":{"detail":"channel_events(within) collects for the whole window; the negative checks (lines 387, 425, 476) pay it in full on purpose.","kind":"waiver","span":{"start":{"line":162},"end":{"line":177},"content_hash":"143d09c57b3760bfb6f63632c6fd6fd946ce15eeeab169ff23e251a9db9078ca"},"summary":"The channel tests wait 3 to 5 s windows to show no second event arrives","tags":["gate-speed","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-mcp/tests/common.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.731776Z","id":"b42d4ebfa66df83f60c7952b63600300af453be578868ad719498bbe400d1897","body":{"detail":"With CLAX_TEST_BIN unset, clax_bin builds clax once per process, and under nextest each test is a process, so each build replaces target/debug/clax while other tests run it. The same fallback is in crates/clax-hooks/tests/golden.rs:13-37. just test and the gates set CLAX_TEST_BIN.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":13},"end":{"line":40},"content_hash":"2f5d33d51f0897726481ac38e2e851d02c82deab59fd8c48d6ffcaa7fe5ff839"},"suggested_fix":"A nextest setup script that sets CLAX_TEST_BIN, once that feature is stable.","summary":"A bare cargo nextest run races on target/debug/clax","tags":["session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
